。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1aEgnAhbZIB2qaardzmk7Ppmr6wKVJ8jN", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Yamamoto_Buncho/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1446623, "client_id": 544969, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/88132bf0/uploads/origins/f6e831f8-1fb7-4ffa-9035-e9bfe93bff57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f5e1ac3437c38c896378cd8355a09eaf", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/88132bf0/uploads/origins/f6e831f8-1fb7-4ffa-9035-e9bfe93bff57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f5e1ac3437c38c896378cd8355a09eaf, https://si.imgix.net/88132bf0/uploads/origins/f6e831f8-1fb7-4ffa-9035-e9bfe93bff57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fa110f641578275e23987d16b739a4d4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/88132bf0/uploads/origins/f6e831f8-1fb7-4ffa-9035-e9bfe93bff57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4a307275bcfb7bd8db13b53b70728051 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/88132bf0/uploads/origins/f6e831f8-1fb7-4ffa-9035-e9bfe93bff57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=253d888c73be7be208078ed6f8cc1403", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/88132bf0/uploads/origins/f6e831f8-1fb7-4ffa-9035-e9bfe93bff57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=253d888c73be7be208078ed6f8cc1403, https://si.imgix.net/88132bf0/uploads/origins/f6e831f8-1fb7-4ffa-9035-e9bfe93bff57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=aed48fe9055b1eebb06fd25ef92b64ed 2x, https://si.imgix.net/88132bf0/uploads/origins/f6e831f8-1fb7-4ffa-9035-e9bfe93bff57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6853b765745f16b6a7cd8e8f5a58253a 3x"}, "body": "Hello! May I request an illustration of my original character?\nHe is a handsome man with a very cheerful and spiritual personality. He is more of a big-hearted man with little common sense. He has a powerful body and is very flexible, but sometimes will be stupid. His job is monster/yokai killer. The world setting is fantasy Chinese. \nYou can draw him in fighting/kung fu poses or holding lots and lots of things/eating. The composition is up to you.\nI would like to have a masked and unmasked version if possible!\nI really like your soft color style, if possible I'd love to have the illustration in similar styles such as these two pictures: https://www.pixiv.net/artworks/105388524   https://twitter.com/Yamamoto_Buncho/status/1630176245748211713\n\nThanks for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1UW_BP5MP1oEamr2iAS8JHDczqZ4kIVUM?usp=share_link", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Yamamoto_Buncho/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1446623, "client_id": 2638754, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c7c61c56/uploads/origins/f0b7c0bf-61eb-4d34-8895-4316d6aec142?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=02b44cc0f661f35328efeead1b719c18", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c7c61c56/uploads/origins/f0b7c0bf-61eb-4d34-8895-4316d6aec142?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=02b44cc0f661f35328efeead1b719c18, https://si.imgix.net/c7c61c56/uploads/origins/f0b7c0bf-61eb-4d34-8895-4316d6aec142?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f88a1c5f41219aea5f238bbd65955b2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c7c61c56/uploads/origins/f0b7c0bf-61eb-4d34-8895-4316d6aec142?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a2331987f822a585c032e90e3b862f05 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c7c61c56/uploads/origins/f0b7c0bf-61eb-4d34-8895-4316d6aec142?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f2931d76a0fff7c012390dfc198d8dc6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c7c61c56/uploads/origins/f0b7c0bf-61eb-4d34-8895-4316d6aec142?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f2931d76a0fff7c012390dfc198d8dc6, https://si.imgix.net/c7c61c56/uploads/origins/f0b7c0bf-61eb-4d34-8895-4316d6aec142?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1bdd40eaba3b192f665a914e40de4108 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c7c61c56/uploads/origins/f0b7c0bf-61eb-4d34-8895-4316d6aec142?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=911e831a0de4e99bac440326901e7af0 3x"}, "body": "始めまして、リクエストさせていただきます。\nもしよろしければ、以下のキャラクターを描いていただけないでしょうか。\n\n■キャラクター:\n銀髪の癒し系少女。人工知能アンドロイド。\n身長は約150cmで、15〜16歳くらいです。\nバカ毛の周りに人工衛星、土星、流星などが浮かんでいます。\n詳細は参照URLをご覧ください。\n\n■シーン:\nポテトチップスを持って食べる姿を描いていただきたいです。\nポテトチップス袋のデザインは、難しい場合は自由に描いていただいて構いません。\nその他、構図や背景などの部分はお任せします。\n\n■イラストの用途:\n・VTuberファンアート\n・SNSの投稿、アイコンやヘッダー、スケジュール\n・生配信での閲覧（非商用）\n\n金額や依頼内容に問題がある場合は、再送要請していただければ幸いです。\nもしお受けいただけない場合は、キャンセルしていただいても大丈夫です。\n何卒ご検討をよろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1kYnaf_LdiAp1u1W3McQfceasAL81FwCj?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Yamamoto_Buncho/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/87c3668e/uploads/origins/eceb8a1e-5824-4e40-971f-03d1ab211eb8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=348bf8ec2fa65b311677652b5